  "description": "Operating Area: Australia\n\nIntroducing Pleiades II, a 110ft classic beauty with upmarket modern Australian interiors, delivering vacations to remember and the perfect environment to unwind. \nUniquely spacious, she is able to accommodate up to 12 guests in five luxury staterooms and boasts sophisticated interiors, as well as vast deck space for relaxing and sunbathing. With cruising range of 4,000 nautical miles she is the ideal super yacht for exploring the breathtaking Australian Coast.",
